  message: "Staleness audit 2026-07-21: this is a seed-quality UMBRELLA; the build-wrapper facet is FIXED (commit 471bb5a779; entrypoints.py:1435-1672 BUILD_WRAPPER_BASENAMES {mvnw,gradlew,...} x0.1 rank demotion gated on SHELL_SCRIPT). Residual facets still reproduce: no rslice tier-1 seed constraint (SliceQuery.max_tier defaults None), no harder vendored-JS demotion beyond tier-3 x0.3 (pdf.worker.js/d3/vue.js still qualify as seeds), and is_utility_file over-match on samples/example/demo (entrypoints.py:1651). The express test-callback facet belongs to WI-zulij. Title left as the umbrella; kept open for the vendored-JS / rslice-tier / is_utility_file facets."  # cc6e
