  message: "G12 attack (2026-07-21): WI-kikis (the group's P1) closed done. WI-batit STAYS OPEN — its remaining facets are bakeoff-gated ranking TUNING, not self-corpus-closeable: (1) harder vendored-JS demotion — tier>=3 library_export seeds get 0.80x0.3=0.24 > the 0.10 exclusion floor, so pdf.worker.js/d3/vue.js still seed slices; the *magnitude* of a harder demotion is a judgment call validated by DEEP bakeoff (the item's own note: 'Affects all 3 bakeoffs'); (2) rslice tier-seed constraint — reverse-slice --entry auto uses the same detect_entrypoints ranking (cli.py:1651), so constraining seeds to tier-1 is the same ranking knob; (3) is_utility_file over-match on samples/example/demo — the item itself flags this DEBATABLE ('a sample repo IS demo code'); (4) express test-callback belongs to WI-zulij (centrality/compact ranking), not this. Decision: do NOT land an unvalidated wide-blast-radius ranking change to dev bundled with the clean WI-kikis close (dev stays deployable); fold WI-batit's prep+validation into a consolidated DEEP bakeoff at a later checkpoint. Build-wrapper facet remains FIXED (471bb5a779)."  # 65cd
